    - target: {fileID: 1736223423933981007, guid: 96048391e5bc0af49b1edfa6e3a2427c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Glass Index of Refraction : 1.5\nSphere Refraction Model\n(Solid Spherical
        Object)\n\n \nThickness is adjusted depending on the sphere radius.\n\nThe
        glass is colored using transmission color. The absorption distance control
        when the refraction effect becomes fully colorized by the Transmission Color.
        Beyond the absorption distance, the object looks darker until it eventually
        absorbs all the light.\n\n\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
